{"synopsis":"Che hanyalah seorang manusia di dunia yang penuh dengan Kimyo yang berkekuatan super tapi dia bertekad untuk menjadi petarung terkuat yang pernah ada\nKetika guru tersayangnya dibunuh Che bersumpah untuk balas dendam dan berangkat dalam sebuah misi untuk mengekspos pembunuhnya\nNamun tak lama kemudian Che mengetahui bahwa dunia Kimyo jauh lebih luas dari yang pernah dia bayangkan dan bahwa dia sendiri mungkin juga salah satu dari mereka  sang Kimyo terkuat di Bumi dengan kekuatan matahari itu sendiri Akankah Che mampu memanfaatkan kekuatan barunya atau apa dia akan terbakar habis dalam panas rintangan ordeal ini","alternative_title":"Updating","author":"Brent Bristol","artist":"","chapters":[{"number":"34","chapter":"34","slug":"9cabd945-7fe1-4583-aada-07f659159227","title":"Chapter 34","date":"2024-11-26"},{"number":"33","chapter":"33","slug":"726f8204-5110-4100-a731-2e3f176a9e50","title":"Chapter 33","date":"2024-11-26"},{"number":"32","chapter":"32","slug":"94d5e57d-9a14-4a88-960d-d8c0323833c8","title":"Chapter 32","date":"2024-11-26"},{"number":"31","chapter":"31","slug":"2b06753a-9b6f-43b8-8f50-4b657749c4f0","title":"Chapter 31","date":"2024-11-26"},{"number":"30","chapter":"30","slug":"21467ef4-0eae-4792-a402-cd7e65e69f1b","title":"Chapter 30","date":"2024-11-26"},{"number":"29","chapter":"29","slug":"d8f5b8c6-f059-4af5-977c-0ab3518cd096","title":"Chapter 29","date":"2024-11-26"},{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"2d949e3e-1da5-41cc-aae9-e624ab31dc53","title":"Chapter 28","date":"2024-11-26"},{"number":"27","chapter":"27","slug":"0455af30-68ff-4f6b-b583-37848cbec35d","title":"Chapter 27","date":"2024-11-26"},{"number":"26","chapter":"26","slug":"72241f61-af3a-422e-9216-c4415b24186b","title":"Chapter 26","date":"2024-11-26"},{"number":"25","chapter":"25","slug":"f8d1d79f-43c4-4b0b-8c55-774a0eba11ba","title":"Chapter 25","date":"2024-11-26"},{"number":"24","chapter":"24","slug":"6f8bd826-8d7d-4f0f-8bf0-7f2a60c2ed61","title":"Chapter 24","date":"2